        "execSummary":  "Anthropic is institutionalizing third-party safety oversight at the model development stage — a structural response to growing regulatory and enterprise demand for verifiable AI governance. For enterprise AI buyers, embedded evaluation by a credible external party like Accenture/Faculty provides a stronger assurance signal than vendor self-attestation alone. This sets a precedent that large enterprises may soon expect — or regulators require — similar independent verification before deploying frontier models in high-stakes workflows. The $1B commitment signals this is a long-term structural arrangement, not a one-time audit.",
