        "execSummary":  "Enterprise Frontier Safeguards directly addresses the top enterprise AI adoption blocker: the tension between privacy compliance and safety monitoring. By enabling misuse detection without Anthropic holding customer data, this architecture unlocks deployment in regulated industries like finance, healthcare, and government where zero-data-retention is non-negotiable. For enterprise AI strategy leaders, this is a meaningful capability that could accelerate procurement approval cycles. Caveat: the effectiveness of customer-controlled safety monitoring depends heavily on the enterprise\u0027s own security operations maturity — this shifts responsibility, not just control.",
