        "summary":  "NVIDIA released Nemotron 3.5 Lightning, a 30-billion-parameter mixture-of-experts model optimized for long-running agentic AI workloads within multi-agent systems. Alongside it, NVIDIA open-sourced NeMo Switchyard, a routing library that intelligently directs requests to the most suitable model — open, proprietary, or NVIDIA — across mixed-model environments without requiring application redesign.",
        "execSummary":  "NVIDIA\u0027s release of an open, efficiency-optimized agentic model paired with an open-source routing library represents a meaningful step toward enterprise-grade multi-agent orchestration that doesn\u0027t require vendor lock-in for every component. NeMo Switchyard\u0027s ability to route across open and proprietary models without application rewrites is particularly relevant for enterprises building agent pipelines that need flexibility as the model landscape evolves. For AI customer-support leaders, lightweight specialized agents like Nemotron 3.5 Lightning are the building blocks of cost-effective, task-specific automation at scale. The open-source routing layer reduces integration risk and is worth evaluating alongside competing orchestration frameworks.",
